&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;8+ years of E‑commerce experience in program management, category management, or business management roles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong Excel and analytical skills&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Data‑driven mindset with solid business logic&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fluent in English and Mandarin&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong cross‑functional communication skills&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience influencing stakeholders without direct authority&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
