&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We care for clients of all ages, diagnoses, and acuity levels. We offer a multitude of paid training to our nurses to feel comfortable and competent prior to working their first shift.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
